flowchart TD
    U[Human user<br/>mood, activity, and music preferences]
    A[AGENT<br/>asks adaptive questions<br/>builds and refines UserProfile]
    R[RAG: RETRIEVAL<br/>searches song metadata and tags]
    D[(DATA STORE<br/>song catalog: data/songs.csv<br/>or expanded music dataset)]
    S[EXISTING SOFTWARE: SCORER/RANKER<br/>scores candidates by mood, genre,<br/>energy, and acousticness]
    G[RAG: GENERATION<br/>creates explanations grounded<br/>in retrieved song data]
    O[Output<br/>ranked song recommendations<br/>with explanations]
    T[TESTING/EVALUATION<br/>ranking, data validation,<br/>explanation, and regression checks]
    H[HUMAN REVIEW<br/>checks relevance, accuracy,<br/>bias, and usefulness]

    U -->|answers and feedback| A
    A -->|structured preferences| R
    D -->|song records and metadata| R
    R -->|relevant candidate songs| S
    S -->|ranked candidates and scores| G
    R -->|retrieved evidence| G
    G --> O
    O -->|recommendation quality feedback| U

    D -->|test fixtures and edge cases| T
    S -->|scores and rankings| T
    G -->|explanations| T
    T -->|pass/fail results and metrics| H
    O -->|sample results for review| H
    H -->|corrections and evaluation insights| A
    H -->|improvements to rules and tests| S